main: standard library package "pluto/nosuchpkg" not found
    Import paths that start with pluto/ name packages of the standard library,
    and this one does not exist. Check the spelling. Go's packages have
    Plutonium versions under pluto/, such as pluto/fmt for fmt, but not every Go
    package has one.
    (see "Import declarations" in the Plutonium spec, section 14.3)
    (run "pluto explain E4005" for a longer explanation)
